# Whitelist .gitignore: ignore everything, then allow only your own files.
# An extracted game file can never be committed by accident.
*
!*/

# Allow: your code, docs and config (adjust to your project)
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.cs
!*.csproj
!*.sln
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.hpp
!CMakeLists.txt
!*.rs
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!*.py
!*.ts
!*.tsx
!*.js
!*.json
!*.ps1
!*.cmd
!*.sh
!*.ini
!*.toml
!*.yml
!*.yaml
!LICENSE*

# Re-block game material even if it matches the allow-list above
decomp/
extracted/
ghidra/
assets-ripped/
**/*.dll
**/*.exe
**/*.pak
**/*.utoc
**/*.ucas
**/*.assets
**/*.bundle
**/*.xex
**/*.iso
